{
    "title": "Screw Pin - Nuts Jam",
    "description": "Let's embark on a mechanical journey like no other in Screw Pin - Jam Puzzle. Your mission is to untwist screws and put them in the right screw boxes. You win when completing all the screw sets.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n- Remove screws in correct order to drop each board, one by one.\r\n- Fill each screw box with the same color screws, you need to fill all of them to win.\r\n- No time limit, relax and play whenever you want.\r\n- Unlimited levels! A lot of Nuts & Bolts strategies await you.\r\n- Multiple boosters can be used to support you in tricky situations\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n- Addictive gameplay, help you relax and train your brain\r\n-  ASMR Screw game: Beautiful design with satisfying in-game sounds\r\n\r\nThis challenging and addictive Screw jam game will put your problem-solving skills to the test as you twist, turn, and put all the screws into right screw boxes.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Let&#39;s embark on a mechanical journey like no other in Screw Pin - Jam Puzzle. Your mission is to untwist screws and put them in the right screw boxes. You win when completing all the screw sets.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>- Remove screws in correct order to drop each board, one by one.<br>- Fill each screw box with the same color screws, you need to fill all of them to win.<br>- No time limit, relax and play whenever you want.<br>- Unlimited levels! A lot of Nuts &amp; Bolts strategies await you.<br>- Multiple boosters can be used to support you in tricky situations<br><br>FEATURES<br>- Addictive gameplay, help you relax and train your brain<br>-  ASMR Screw game: Beautiful design with satisfying in-game sounds<br><br>This challenging and addictive Screw jam game will put your problem-solving skills to the test as you twist, turn, and put all the screws into right screw boxes.",
